MIT license, copyright Joao Chrisostomo; full notice is in the source.
This is the neutral ArtCNN model, not the separately trained Ani4Kv2 model.

The WGSL files in crates/adv-shell/src/upscaling are generated adaptations.
Regenerate with tools/upscaling/generate.py and Slang 2026.19.
The adapter supplies texture bindings, dimensions, and compute entry points.
Convolutions use FP32 arithmetic and preserve each intermediate storage format.
ArtCNN processes BT.709 luma while retaining bilinearly sampled RGB chroma.
